		{
			"id": "style-room",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## fmv-room\nstyle\n# Pre-rendered 1990s CG rooms. Use with model: z-image.\nprefix: A still frame from a 1995 CD-ROM computer game, a pre-rendered 3D CGI background, early 1990s 3D rendering with flat shading, low-polygon models and simple textures\nsuffix: no people, no text or lettering",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1400,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 260,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "style-actor-green",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## fmv-actor-green\nstyle\n# Live actors on a green screen, to key out. Use with model: krea-2.\n# Keep green out of the wardrobe.\nprefix: A 1995 video capture of a live-action actor filmed for a CD-ROM game on a chroma-key stage\nsuffix: standing in front of a solid bright chroma-key green screen, solid pure green #00FF00 background, evenly lit",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1720,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "guard-booth",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## guard-booth\nimage\nstatus: done\nmodel: z-image\nsize: 1024x768\nseed: 41\nprompt: interior view from inside an empty cramped night-shift guard room, the back wall fills the frame, a desk against the wall with a bank of CRT security monitors, a wall-mounted intercom panel with a handset, venetian blinds on a dark window, a swivel chair, amber CRT glow and sickly fluorescent tube light",
			"x": 640,
			"y": 1400,
			"width": 560,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "guard-actor",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## guard-actor\nimage\nstatus: done\nmodel: krea-2\nsize: 1024x768\nseed: 42\nprompt: a waist-up shot of a middle-aged night security guard with grey slicked-back hair, a thick grey mustache and a tired, stern face, black security uniform shirt with shoulder epaulettes and a silver badge, leaning toward the camera as if speaking into an intercom, stiff posture, eyes slightly off-camera",
			"x": 640,
			"y": 1740,
			"width": 560,
			"height": 320,
			"color": "4"
