		{
			"id": "readme",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# Assets\nMake game art with AI, right here. Each **recipe card** makes one asset.\n\n**Right-click a recipe card:**\n- **Generate \"name\" now** runs it.\n- **Preview request (free)** shows what would be sent.\n- **Status: idea / go** sets it to wait or to run.\n\nThe card turns **yellow** while running, **green** when done, **red** on an error. The result appears as a card to the right, and in `assets/generated/`. Animations also get an **MP4** and pictures a **JPG**, for sharing in apps that do not show WebP.\n\n**Style cards** add their LoRA and prompt words to every recipe they point to. **Composite cards** paste an actor (arrow labelled `actor`, on a green or blue screen) into a room (arrow labelled `room`). Free: no AI call. See the night guard below.\n\n**Animate cards** start from the image that points to them, and keep a few held frames like a 90s CD-ROM game.\n\n`Cmd+P` → *Game Tools* also has: generate every card set to go, watch this canvas, play the game, and open the workbench.",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -680,
			"width": 1100,
			"height": 600
		},
		{
			"id": "models",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Models (checked 30 Sep 2026)\n| model: | What | LoRAs |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `flux-lora` | FLUX.1 [dev] | FLUX.1 LoRAs, e.g. Civitai \"[FLUX]\" ones |\n| `flux-2-lora` | FLUX.2 [dev] | FLUX.2 LoRAs only |\n| `minimax-h3` | MiniMax H3 image→video, first + last frame | — |\n\nFLUX.1 LoRAs **do not** load on FLUX.2. To move the FMV look to FLUX.2, train a FLUX.2 LoRA on fal (about $6 for 1000 steps).\n\n**RefMod** (MiniMax H3 reference adapters) runs only in local ComfyUI with a GPU, and is still \"under construction\". Not usable through fal yet.\n\nAny other fal model: set `endpoint:` and `params:`.",
			"x": 1180,
			"y": -520,
			"width": 760,
			"height": 440,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "style-fmv",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## fmv-90s\nstyle\n# 90's PC Game FMV Style [FLUX] by its Civitai author, trained on Phantasmagoria and Harvester.\n# https://civitai.red/models/940053/90s-pc-game-fmv-style-flux — FLUX.1 [dev] only. Strength 0.8–1.0.\nlora: https://civitai.com/api/download/models/1052352?fileId=1010413 @0.9\ntemplate: \"The image is a screenshot from a 3D-rendered scene, possibly from a video game or a virtual environment. The scene depicts {prompt}\"\n# Crunch: shrink 4x, save as a low-quality JPEG, blow back up with no smoothing.\ncrunch: 4\njpeg: 50\n",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 400,
			"color": "5"
		},
